"""Texture-set definitions for public/assets/textures (PBR sets) and public/assets/hdri.

Each entry: output id -> source + processing options.
  src:    'ph:<id>'  Poly Haven texture (CC0)            https://polyhaven.com/a/<id>
          'acg:<id>' ambientCG material/atlas/decal (CC0) https://ambientcg.com/a/<id>
          'tc:<id>'  TextureCan (CC0)                     https://texturecan.com
          'gen:<name>' generated by tools/assets/textures/generate.py (CC0, this project)
  size:   output edge in px (albedo/normal/arm). Terrain sets also get height.jpg at 1024.
  tile_m: real-world size of one texture repeat in meters (Poly Haven 'dimensions' / ambientCG dimensionX
          when published; 'est' marks an estimate from visual feature sizes).
  rough:  optional [min,max] remap of the source roughness (1..99 percentile) when the scan's values are implausible.
  adjust: optional albedo tweak {sat, gain, gamma, hue_shift_deg, tint:[r,g,b]} applied in sRGB space.
"""

